  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Hei tribe Iron Eagle blessed land, Murong Qing Si finds affinity wood as a rootless tree growing in a pond. Cloud Gentleman Yun Liang is already collecting it. Affinity wood is only a rank six immortal material, but it suits her, and he warns that it is very fragile: the collection process cannot have any interference. After he finishes gathering it, they spar without a decided victor, and he gives her half.",
