      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Affinity wood is a rootless tree that grew in the air. It is extremely fragile: any disturbance while gathering it can destroy this highly valuable immortal material. Murong Qing Si and Yun Liang first see each other at Hei tribe’s Iron Eagle blessed land and fall into conflict over it. She does not attack, waiting quietly for him to finish collecting, and he elegantly offers to spar with the winner taking all the affinity wood.",
